          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Assyria can never save us, and war horses cannot protect us. We will never again say to our idols that they are our God. O ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.14.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.14.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", you show mercy to those who have no one else to turn to.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.14.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.14.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
